<span id="S2.T1.4.1.1.1.2.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding:-0.4pt 2.0pt;">1.36%</span>
<span id="S2.T1.4.1.1.1.2.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center" style="padding:-0.4pt 2.0pt;">2.71%</span>
