<span id="S2.T2.2.1.1.1.4.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" style="padding:-0.4pt 2.0pt;">25.38 / 0.7207</span>
<span id="S2.T2.2.1.1.1.4.7" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding:-0.4pt 2.0pt;">25.41 / 0.7219</span>
