<span id="S2.T2.2.1.1.1.7.7" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb ltx_border_r ltx_border_t" style="padding:-0.4pt 2.0pt;">26.82 / 0.7212</span>
<span id="S2.T2.2.1.1.1.7.8" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb ltx_border_t" style="padding:-0.4pt 2.0pt;">27.71 / 0.7548</span></span>
